# Every figure is named experiment_<experiment id>_<dataset>_<content>.png, so a figure maps to one
# experiment and one document. They are evidence and they are committed in docs/, so they are excepted
# from the plot rule. curves.py, block_sweep.py and l1_report.py write them and nothing else does.
# Keep this last, because the last matching rule wins.
!docs/experiment_*.png
